CLAUDE.md
# Agent settings stay on this machine: the preview server list holds local
# paths, and the attribution setting belongs to one person's tooling. Nothing
# in the build, the dev server or the deploy reads this folder.
.claude/

# media-src/ is the raw archive: whatever came out of the camera, the screen
# recorder or the export dialog, named after the file it produces in
# public/media/. The site is built from public/, so the masters never need to
# travel with the repo — and they are tens of megabytes each. Local only, in
# every format; the published derivatives are what is versioned.
media-src/

# Rules and working notes stay on this machine: the repository is public, and
# the design and editorial rules, the build spec, the content audit, the agent
# guide, and every internal review, state or strategy file are not for it.
docs/
SPEC.md
CONTENT-AUDIT.md
AGENTS.md

# Editor tasks for the dev server and the pre-push check are one person's
# setup; the npm scripts are what the site needs.
.vscode/tasks.json
